=\frac{-x\sqrt{4+1/x^2}}{x\bigl(1-3/x\bigr)}
=\frac{-\sqrt{4+1/x^2}}{1-3/x}
\to\frac{-2}{1}=-2.
\]

**Final answer.** \(2\) and \(-2\)

