ELEC:9924069.canonicalSolution:
**(a)** With \(v_{GS}=v_G\) and \(v_{DS}=v_D\):
- cutoff: \(v_G<0.70\,\mathrm{V}\) (then \(i_D=0\), \(v_D=10.0\,\mathrm{V}\));
- triode: \(v_G\ge 0.70\,\mathrm{V}\) and \(0\le v_D<v_G-0.70\,\mathrm{V}\);
- saturation: \(v_G\ge 0.70\,\mathrm{V}\) and \(v_D\ge v_G-0.70\,\mathrm{V}\).

**(b)** \(v_G=1.80\,\mathrm{V}>0.70\,\mathrm{V}\), so not cutoff. Overdrive \(v_{OV}=1.10\,\mathrm{V}\). Saturation candidate:
\[
i_D=\tfrac12(0.80\,\mathrm{mA}/\mathrm{V}^2)(1.10\,\mathrm{V})^2=0.484\,\mathrm{mA},
\]
\[
v_D=10.0- (0.484\,\mathrm{mA})(5.00\,\mathrm{k}\Omega)=7.58\,\mathrm{V}.
\]
Test: \(7.58\,\mathrm{V}\ge 1.10\,\mathrm{V}\), consistent. A triode candidate would need \(v_D<1.10\,\mathrm{V}\), which this \(v_D\) is not. Unique consistent region: **saturation**, \(i_D=0.484\,\mathrm{mA}\), \(v_D=7.58\,\mathrm{V}\).

**(c)** Passive on \(R_D\): \(p_{R_D}=(V_{DD}-v_D)i_D=(2.42\,\mathrm{V})(0.484\,\mathrm{mA})=1.17\,\mathrm{mW}\).
Passive on the MOSFET: \(p_{\mathrm{MOS}}=v_D i_D=(7.58\,\mathrm{V})(0.484\,\mathrm{mA})=3.67\,\mathrm{mW}\).
Active on the supply (gate current is zero): \(p_{\mathrm{sup}}=V_{DD}i_D=4.84\,\mathrm{mW}\) delivered.
Check: \(1.17128+3.66872-4.84=0\).

**(d)** Current through \(R_D\) toward the drain node equals \(i_D=0.484\,\mathrm{mA}\); current leaving that node into the MOSFET drain is the same \(0.484\,\mathrm{mA}\); \(i_G=0\). KCL: \(i_{R_D}-i_D=0\).

\[\boxed{(a)\ \text{cutoff }v_G<0.70\,\mathrm{V};\ \text{triode }v_G\ge 0.70\,\mathrm{V},\ v_D<v_G-0.70\,\mathrm{V};\ \text{sat }v_G\ge 0.70\,\mathrm{V},\ v_D\ge v_G-0.70\,\mathrm{V}
} \]
\[\boxed{(b)\ \text{saturation},\ i_D=0.484\,\mathrm{mA},\ v_D=7.58\,\mathrm{V}
} \]
\[\boxed{(c)\ p_{R_D}=1.17\,\mathrm{mW},\ p_{\mathrm{MOS}}=3.67\,\mathrm{mW},\ p_{\mathrm{sup}}=4.84\,\mathrm{mW};\ \text{sum }0
} \]
\[\boxed{(d)\ i_{R_D}=i_D=0.484\,\mathrm{mA}
} \]

