**(b)** \(v_{OV}=1.60-0.80=0.80\,\mathrm{V}\). At \(v_{DS}=3.00\,\mathrm{V}\ge 0.80\,\mathrm{V}\) the MOSFET is in **saturation**, so
\[
i_D=\tfrac12(1.25)(0.80)^2=0.400\,\mathrm{mA}\neq 3.00\,\mathrm{mA}.
\]
