EMB:9925023.statement:
A 16-bit external memory is attached to a microcontroller with data bus \(D_{15}\ldots D_{0}\) and byte-enable strobes. Word addresses are formed from address bits \(A_{15}\ldots A_{1}\); bit \(A_{0}\) is not wired to the memory’s address pins. Active-low strobes are

