EMB:9925173.canonicalSolution:
**Assumptions.** Constant cycle cost per block; no cache or stalls. Inner header executes \(M\) times per outer iteration (\(M-1\) continue, one exit). Outer header executes \(N\) times (\(N-1\) continue, one exit). \(N=8\) is fixed in (d).

**(a)** \(N=8\), \(M=12\):
- \(B_{\mathrm{body}}\): \(NM=96\);
- continuing inner branch: \(N(M-1)=88\);
- exiting inner branch: \(N=8\);
- \(B_{\mathrm{inner-exit}}\): \(N=8\);
- continuing outer branch: \(N-1=7\);
- exiting outer branch: \(1\);
- \(B_{\mathrm{outer-exit}}\): \(1\);
- prologue: \(1\).

**(b)**
\[
\begin{align*}
\mathrm{WCET}
&=96\cdot 9+88\cdot 3+8\cdot 2+8\cdot 4+7\cdot 3+1\cdot 2+6+7\\
&=864+264+16+32+21+2+6+7=1212
\end{align*}
\]
cycles. Time \(1212/48\,\mu\mathrm{s}=25.25\,\mu\mathrm{s}\).

**(c)** Pair: \(2\times 1212+2\times 5=2434\) cycles. Deadline \(40.0\,\mu\mathrm{s}=1920\) cycles. \(2434>1920\), **miss**.

**(d)** Terms that scale with \(M\) (at fixed \(N=8\)): \(B_{\mathrm{body}}\) (\(8M\) times) and continuing inner branches (\(8(M-1)\) times). Closed form
\[
\mathrm{WCET}(8,M)=72M+24(M-1)+16+32+23+13=96M+60.
\]
(Check: \(M=12\) gives \(1212\).) For \(M=16\): \(96\cdot 16+60=1596\) cycles.
Need \(96M+60\le 25\times 48=1200\), so \(M\le 11.875\). Largest integer \(M=11\) (\(1116\le 1200\); \(M=12\) is \(1212>1200\)).

\[\boxed{(a)\ 96,\ 88,\ 8,\ 8,\ 7,\ 1,\ 1,\ 1}\]
\[\boxed{(b)\ 1212\text{ cycles}=25.25\,\mu\mathrm{s}}\]
\[\boxed{(c)\ 2434\text{ cycles}>1920,\ \text{miss}}\]
\[\boxed{(d)\ 1596\text{ cycles};\ M_{\max}=11}\]

