\[
\Delta(s)=s^3+7s^2+(14+K)s+(8-K).
\]
Array:
\[
\begin{array}{c|cc}
s^3 & 1 & 14+K \\
s^2 & 7 & 8-K \\
s^1 & \dfrac{90+8K}{7} & 0 \\
s^0 & 8-K &
\end{array}
