\[
20\log_{10}|L_{\mathrm{rb}}(\mathrm{j}12)|=-24.15\,\mathrm{dB},\qquad
20\log_{10}|L_{\mathrm{rb}}(\mathrm{j}16)|=-29.12\,\mathrm{dB}.
\]

(b) The normalised numerator quadratic at \(s=\mathrm{j}\omega_z\) equals \(\mathrm{j}2\zeta_z\), of modulus \(2\zeta_z=0.100\), hence \(-20.00\,\mathrm{dB}\). The normalised denominator quadratic at \(s=\mathrm{j}\omega_p\) equals \(\mathrm{j}2\zeta_p\), likewise \(-20.00\,\mathrm{dB}\). Full \(L\):
\[
\begin{aligned}
\omega=\omega_z=12.0:&\quad |L|=7.859\times 10^{-3},\quad -42.09\,\mathrm{dB},\quad \arg=-92.60^\circ,\\
\omega=\omega_p=16.0:&\quad |L|=0.1554,\quad -16.17\,\mathrm{dB},\quad \arg=-94.37^\circ.
\end{aligned}
\]
